      <p>Arvind Krishna is a name that resonates strongly in the world of technology and business. Born on February 1, 1962, in Andhra Pradesh, India, Krishna has emerged as a prominent figure in the global tech scene, known for his groundbreaking contributions and leadership roles. As of my last knowledge update in January 2022, Arvind Krishna serves as the Chairman and Chief Executive Officer (CEO) of IBM, one of the world's leading technology and consulting companies.</p>
      
