      <p>One of Krishna's notable contributions is his involvement in the development of IBM's cloud and cognitive software. As Senior Vice President of Cloud and Cognitive Software, he led the division that encompasses key products like Red Hat, which IBM acquired in 2019. This strategic move marked IBM's commitment to open-source software and hybrid cloud solutions.</p>
      
